    <description>Manual Risk Flag (Red Flag Alert) is a Master Flow run from the Account record. Prompts user to enter Business Function and Trigger after Account is manually flagged as red. Flow updates Account, IMGA Risk Assessment, and Creates New Flow State. Sends outbound email to the User/Assessor, User&apos;s Director, and User&apos;s VP.</description>
